          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kivala cha vavugura, kandi ni vamenya mu chaali harara na Bezeli kandi na madaala agakikumbiriza, kali kuduuka Ivugwi kuli Naarani kandi Imadioli Gezeri na madaala agakikumbiriza. Gaali harara kandi na madaala manene ga Shekemu na Aya, kandi madaala agakikumbiriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Visukululwi via Manase viamiha madaala manene ga Bezi Shani, Tanaki, Megido, kandi Dori, harara na madaala gago gagakumbiriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaga goosi nigo madaala gi visukululwi via Josefu, muyaayi wa Yakobo viamenya mu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
